	{"stats detail counts", "stats detail on\r\nset foo:a 0 0 1\r\nx\r\nget foo:a foo:b bar\r\nincr foo:a 1\r\ntouch foo:a 1\r\ndelete foo:a\r\ndelete foo:z\r\nstats detail off\r\nget foo:q\r\nstats detail dump\r\n", "OK\r\nSTORED\r\nVALUE foo:a 0 1\r\nx\r\nEND\r\nCLIENT_ERROR cannot increment or decrement non-numeric value\r\nTOUCHED\r\nDELETED\r\nNOT_FOUND\r\nOK\r\nEND\r\nPREFIX foo get 2 hit 1 set 1 del 2\r\nEND\r\n"},
